@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamAlifModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Alif";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Alif</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A barista who keeps growing through craft, repetition, and sincerity—
                    especially in the part of coffee he loves most: latte art.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Barista</span>
                    <span>Latte Art</span>
                    <span>Service</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/alif.jpg" alt="Alif">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">His Journey</p>
                <h3>Growing Through Every Cup</h3>

                <p>
                    For Alif, the world of coffee is not something new.
                    But since joining Kopi Cinta in 2024, he found a space
                    where he could continue growing in a more meaningful way.
                </p>

                <p>
                    As someone who already had barista experience,
                    he arrived with skills—but also with a strong desire
                    to keep refining his craft and service.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>His Focus</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Barista craft</li>
                    <li>Latte art practice</li>
                    <li>Customer service</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Practice</p>
                <h3>Learning Never Really Stops</h3>

                <p>
                    At Kopi Cinta, every quiet moment becomes a chance to practice,
                    and every order becomes an opportunity to improve.
                </p>

                <p>
                    For Alif, growth happens through repetition,
                    small progress, and the joy of seeing his skills develop over time.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Challenge</p>
                <h3>When Communication Becomes Harder</h3>

                <p>
                    One challenge Alif often faces is communication,
                    especially when customers wear masks and lip-reading becomes difficult.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Even so, he always finds a way—
                    through gestures, repetition, or inviting customers
                    to point directly at the menu.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>His Message</h3>
            <p>
                If possible, Alif hopes customers can speak clearly
                or avoid covering their mouths.
            </p>
            <p>
                Even simply pointing at the menu can make communication easier.
                For him, every cup is not just about taste—
                it is about craft, sincerity, and connection.
            </p>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>